{"v":1,"book":"gita","n":10,"voice":"en-GB-SoniaNeural","engine":"edge","duration":380.136,"segs":[{"b":0,"part":0,"text":"The Supreme Lord said: O Arjuna, listen once again to My supreme word that I shall speak to you, who are very dear to Me, for your welfare.","start":0.0,"dur":8.424,"words":[[0.138,0.113,"The"],[0.263,0.463,"Supreme"],[0.738,0.25,"Lord"],[1.0,0.312,"said"],[1.575,0.113,"O"],[1.7,0.588,"Arjuna"],[2.562,0.287,"listen"],[2.862,0.25,"once"],[3.125,0.275,"again"],[3.413,0.1,"to"],[3.525,0.138,"My"],[3.675,0.5,"supreme"],[4.188,0.338,"word"],[4.537,0.15,"that"],[4.7,0.087,"I"],[4.8,0.175,"shall"],[4.987,0.312,"speak"],[5.312,0.113,"to"],[5.438,0.2,"you"],[5.95,0.075,"who"],[6.037,0.075,"are"],[6.125,0.3,"very"],[6.438,0.237,"dear"],[6.688,0.113,"to"],[6.812,0.212,"Me"],[7.2,0.087,"for"],[7.3,0.138,"your"],[7.45,0.613,"welfare"]]},{"b":1,"part":0,"text":"God is the origin of everything","start":8.424,"dur":2.448,"words":[[0.113,0.325,"God"],[0.45,0.2,"is"],[0.662,0.138,"the"],[0.812,0.475,"origin"],[1.3,0.1,"of"],[1.413,0.675,"everything"]]},{"b":2,"part":0,"text":"Neither the celestial controllers (Devas), nor the great sages know My origin because I am the origin of all Devas and great sages also. One who knows Me as the unborn, the beginningless, and the Supreme Lord of the universe, is considered wise among the mortals and becomes liberated from the bondage of Karma. Intelligence, Self-knowledge, non-delusion, forgiveness, truthfulness, control over the mind and senses, tranquility, pleasure, pain, birth, death, fear, fearlessness, nonviolence, calmness, contentment, austerity, charity, fame, ill fame — these diverse qualities in human beings also arise from Me. The seven great sages from whom all the creatures of the world were born, originated from My potential energy.","start":10.872,"dur":47.136,"words":[[0.138,0.375,"Neither"],[0.525,0.125,"the"],[0.662,0.575,"celestial"],[1.25,0.713,"controllers"],[2.175,0.537,"Devas"],[3.0,0.188,"nor"],[3.2,