,"text":"I am the holy fig tree among the trees, and I am all other celestial rulers. Know Me as the celestial animal among the animals and the King among men. I am the thunderbolt among weapons, and I am Cupid for procreation. I am the water god and the manes. I am the controller of death. I am death among the healers, lion among the beasts, and the king of birds among birds. I am the wind among the purifiers and Lord Rama among the warriors. I am the crocodile among the fishes and the holy Ganga river among the rivers.","start":237.144,"dur":33.84,"words":[[0.138,0.125,"I"],[0.275,0.163,"am"],[0.45,0.075,"the"],[0.537,0.362,"holy"],[0.912,0.263,"fig"],[1.188,0.3,"tree"],[1.5,0.263,"among"],[1.775,0.087,"the"],[1.875,0.512,"trees"],[2.675,0.125,"and"],[2.812,0.075,"I"],[2.9,0.15,"am"],[3.062,0.225,"all"],[3.3,0.225,"other"],[3.538,0.613,"celestial"],[4.162,0.588,"rulers"],[5.15,0.25,"Know"],[5.412,0.275,"Me"],[5.7,0.188,"as"],[5.9,0.113,"the"],[6.025,0.625,"celestial"],[6.662,0.463,"animal"],[7.138,0.263,"among"],[7.412,0.125,"the"],[7.55,0.575,"animals"],[8.137,0.15,"and"],[8.3,0.1,"the"],[8.412,0.312,"King"],[8.738,0.287,"among"],[9.037,0.388,"men"],[9.825,0.125,"I"],[9.963,0.163,"am"],[10.137,0.1,"the"],[10.25,0.65,"thunderbolt"],[10.912,0.25,"among"],[11.175,0.562,"weapons"],[12.012,0.125,"and"],[12.15,0.075,"I"],[12.238,0.138,"am"],[12.387,0.463,"Cupid"],[12.863,0.138,"for"],[13.012,0.9,"procreation"],[14.312,0.125,"I"],[14.45,0.163,"am"],[14.625,0.1,"the"],[14.738,0.388,"water"],[15.137,0.338,"god"],[15.488,0.15,"and"],[15.65,0.087,"the"],[15.75,0.613,"manes"],[16.762,0.138,"I"],[16.913,0.2,"am"],[17.125,0.1,"the"],[17.238,0.65,"controller"],[17.9,0.175,"of"],[18.087,0.487,"death"],[18.975,0.138,"I"],[19.125,0.188,"am"],[19.325,0.325,"death"],[19.663,0.25,"among"],[19.925,0.075,"the"],[20.012,0.562,"healers"],[20.85,0.338,"lion"],[21.2,0.237,"among"],[21.45,0.1,"the"],[21.562,0.512,"beasts"],[22.312,0.087,"and"],[22.413,0.1,"the"],[22.525,0.225,"king"],[22.76